    "title": "Henrietta ISD's Cruse Coleman is this week's Game Changer - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alvin Runnels ,\n1 days ago HENRIETTA, Texas (KAUZ) - This week’s Game Changer is Henrietta running back Cruse Coleman, earning the honor for the second time this season and for good reason. In his latest outing against Callisburg, Coleman rushed for 108 yards and scored four touchdowns. Those scores helped him secure his fourth school record, this time for the most touchdowns in a single season. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
